n episode two we see it being used for  its actual  purpose the prison break made me think  of raising arizona  of course there was a lot less mud but  it definitely had the same kind of feel  as was the opening narration which had a  similar feel as well  i haven't had a chance to go back and  really look but i'm sure there's plenty  more that i missed at this point  as i mentioned there are a ton of  characters it was almost a little bit  overwhelming and it made it so that none  of them really were driving the story  it'll be interesting to see where they  go i mean obviously we're gonna have a  clash  between the two families but beyond that  we'll just have to wait and see because  there's a lot going on  i'm interested to hear what you think so  let me know in the comments  who do you think's gonna eat the pie  what's gonna happen when they do  do you think the fadas can keep gaitano  on the leash or is there gonna be  a power struggle inside the family  what's gonna happen with the fugitives  when the marshals knock on the front  door  and what do you think that orienta's  backstory is and her motivation will be  going forward as the season progresses  with that i'm going to leave it there  let me know what you think please like  this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already thanks for watching  i'll talk to you soon


